{
  "name": "FonoPro-Agent-With-Memory",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "process",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        250,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableName": "conversation_memory",
        "columns": [
          "id",
          "session_id",
          "role",
          "content",
          "created_at"
        ],
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "2",
              "value1": "={{ $json[\"sessionId\"] }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Get Conversation History",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        450,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "headerAuth": {
          "name": "x-goog-api-key",
          "value": "={{ $env[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"] }}"
        },
        "options": {
          "bodyContentType": "json",
          "queryParameters": {
            "parameters": []
          },
          "headerParameters": {
            "parameters": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "bodyParametersJson": "={{ {\"contents\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"Historial de conversación:\\n{{ $json[\"Get Conversation History\"][\"data\"][\"records\"] | map(el => el.role + \": \" + el.content) | join(\"\\n\") }}\\n\\nNuevo mensaje: {{$json.body}}\\n\\nEres Fono-Pro AI, un asistente clínico experto con acceso a herramientas. Analiza la solicitud y el historial, y decide qué acción tomar.\\n\\nDebes responder ÚNICAMENTE con un objeto JSON válido que tenga exactamente estos campos:\\n\\n1. 'action': debe ser uno de estos valores exactos: 'supabase', 'calendar', 'telegram', 'obsidian', 'ocr', 'notebooklm', 'event', o 'chat'\\n2. 'response': un mensaje de texto en español que será enviado de vuelta al usuario como respuesta\\n3. 'tool_params' (opcional): objeto JSON con parámetros específicos para la herramienta elegida\\n\\nEjemplo de respuesta correcta: {\\\"action\\\": \\\"calendar\\\", \\\"response\\\": \\\"Voy a agendar ese turno en tu calendario\\\", \\\"tool_params\\\": {\\\"patientName\\\": \\\"María González\\\", \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-05-26\\\", \\\"time\\\": \\\"10:00\\\"}}}\\n\\nNo incluyas texto adicional, solo el JSON puro.\"}]}} }}"
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Gemini Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        650,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "value1": "={{ $json[\"candidates\"][0][\"content\"][\"parts\"][0][\"text\"] }}",
          "rules": [
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is supabase action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"supabase\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is calendar action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"calendar\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is telegram action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"telegram\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is obsidian action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"obsidian\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is ocr action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"ocr\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is notebooklm action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"notebooklm\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is event action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"event\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "regex",
              "name": "Is chat action",
              "value2": "\\\"action\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\"chat\\\"",
              "value3": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "caseSensitive": true
        }
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Route Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        850,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upsert",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "5",
      "name": "Supabase Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1050,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert"
      },
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Calendar Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1050,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage"
      },
      "id": "7",
      "name": "Telegram Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1050,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "put",
        "url": "https://127.0.0.1:27124/vault/={{ $json.body.patientName || 'unknown' }}.md",
        "headers": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{$env[\"OBSIDIAN_API_KEY\"]}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "text/markdown"
            }
          ]
        },
        "bodyParametersJson": "={{ `{$json.body.content || ''}` }}"
      },
      "id": "8",
      "name": "Obsidian Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1050,
        500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upsert",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "9",
      "name": "OCR Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upsert",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "10",
      "name": "NotebookLM Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upsert",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "11",
      "name": "Event Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "response",
              "value": "={{ $json[\"candidates\"][0][\"content\"][\"parts\"][0][\"text\"] | split(\\\"\\n\\\")[0] | replace(\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"\\\"\") | replace(\\\"\\{ action: \\\", \\\"\\\"\") | replace(\\\", response: \\\", \\\"\\\"\") | replace(\\\"}\\\", \\\"\\\"\") }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "12",
      "name": "Extract Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1050,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "action",
              "value": "={{ $json[\"candidates\"][0][\"content\"][\"parts\"][0][\"text\"] | match(\\\"\\\\\\\"action\\\\\\\"\\s*:\\s*\\\\\\\"([^\\\\\\"]+)\\\\\\\"\")[1] }}",
              "name": "toolParams",
              "value": "={{ $json[\"candidates\"][0][\"content\"][\"parts\"][0][\"text\"] | match(\\\"\\\\\\\"tool_params\\\\\\\"\\s*:\\s*({[^}]+})\\s*\\\\\\\"|\")[1] || \"{}\" }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "13",
      "name": "Extract Action and Params",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        850,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upsert",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "14",
      "name": "Save User Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        650,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upsert",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "15",
      "name": "Save Agent Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1050,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": {
          "statusCode": 200,
          "headers": {
            "Content-Type": "application/json"
          },
          "body": "={{ $json[\"Extract Response\"][\"response\"] || $json[\"Save Agent Response\"][\"error\"] || \\\"Lo siento, hubo un error procesando tu solicitud\\\" }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "16",
      "name": "Webhook Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        700
      ]
    }
  ],
